  "description": "Master any terrain\nBuilt to go full gas when the trail gets steep, fast and unforgiving, Sythe RS is made for riders who never hold back. Progressive, proportionally-sized geometry and premium Quad-Link 4 suspension deliver exceptional stability and control through rough terrain, big hits and high-speed lines, while balanced handling keeps it precise when trails tighten up. Efficient enough to earn every descent and tough enough for year-round abuse, Sythe RS is a hard-charging enduro bike that stays composed when things get wild and encourages you to push harder every ride.\n\nHighlights\n– 170mm front + 160mm rear of Whyte custom-tuned suspension travel (RockShox Lyrik Ultimate RC2 29in fork + RockShox Super Deluxe Ultimate RC2 rear shock).\n– 6061 hydroformed T6 multi-butted alloy frame + geometry adjustment.\n– Proportional sizing delivers perfect fit and uncompromised handling for every rider.\n– SRAM Eagle S-100 1x12 transmission (30T chainring x 10-52T cassette).\n– TRP EVO Expert four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (203mm rotors front + rear).\n– Full-insertion dropper post (with frame size size-specific drop).\n– MX/mixed/’mullet’ wheels (29in front, 27.5in rear) + Schwalbe Magic Mary Radial tyres (ready to be converted to full 29in front and rear (sizes M, L + XL only)).\n\nIdeal for... Gravity thrill seekers, enduro racers, bike-park shredders and big mountain riders looking for the best descending performance in a long-lasting alloy package.",
